WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:04.440
What's up guys, my name is Colin McNeil for theScore esports.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.600
You know in CS:GO there are few things sexier than the one-tap.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.740
Just left clicking on a head and watching explode. So satisfying.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.760
(Casting)

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.300
Now before we get into the list guys, there was a huge debate in the office about what a one-tap actually is.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:29.240
Do Deagle headshots count? Should they be on this list? Should they get their own separate list?

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.260
At the end of the day we decided to compromise and give you one mega-list with the best one-taps

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.800
and one-deags. But if you think, one-deags should get their own Top 10 list,

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.020
let us know in the comments below. We can probably make it happen.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:48.500
Oh and one more thing guys, I'm gonna need you to go ahead and give that subscribe button just one tap.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.640
Thank you very much.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.560
Without further ado, here are the Top 10 one-taps from CS:GO.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:02.280
Kicking off our list is none other than Coldzera once again reminding us just how good he is.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:07.800
Playing on Nuke against G2 Esports at IEM Oakland 2017

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.800
Cold kicks off the play with a dirty deag on RpK before delivering a crispy one-tap to Shox.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:28.260
(Casting)

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:33.860
From one CS:GO god to another, number nine sees s1mple giving Team Liquid

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.120
a taste of what they’ve been missing since he left,

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.560
landing three consecutive one-taps with the USP.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:53.640
(Casting)

00:01:53.640 --> 00:02:01.580
Coming in at number eight is dennis melting three G2 players with a USP so fast that you’ll miss it if you blink.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.190
(Casting)

