Our next set of one-taps came up when it mattered the most — in the Grand Finals

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:47.180
of IEM Katowice 2017. Down a Map to FaZe Clan and trailing by two rounds on Overpass,

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:55.540
dupreeh put Astralis on his back with this insane ace with the Deagle, including three consecutive one taps.

